      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Makes complete sense. A concrete way this bites users today:\n1. User sets up inheritance, sharing keys and descriptors with heirs.\n2. User encrypts the wallet. New active descriptors are generated from a new seed, and the shared descriptor is deactivated.\n3. The inheritance setup is now stale and has to be redone. Nothing tells the user this.",
      "user": {
        "login": "PraneethGunas",
